    "notes": {
        "582a9f77-0313-4e61-bf31-8adff494bd48": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 1150,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 300,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe connected account must be a **site administrator** (the webhook triggers register Tableau webhooks). The site needs a **workbook with an extract**, a **published data source with an extract** and at least one **extract refresh task** (a scheduled refresh). The `Wait 1m` must stay: Job Finished records the existing jobs on its first poll and only fires for jobs that finish later. Refreshes take minutes, so AfterAll waits up to 40 minutes.\n\nThe workbook and data source refreshes run with **Fail if the job doesn't succeed** on (a failed refresh fails the flow); the data source refresh is **Incremental** (REST API 3.28, the site must run Tableau Cloud or Server 2026.1+). Run Extract Refresh Task keeps the option off: its assertion accepts Success, Failed or Cancelled."
        }
    }
